246
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:15,280
I can't believe I thought of getting back together with you.

247
00:15:15,450 --> 00:15:17,290
We are so over!

248
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,410
Fine by me!

249
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:25,340
And just so you know, it's not that common...

250
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:28,840
it doesn't happen to every guy, and it is a big deal!

251
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:31,880
I knew it!

252
00:15:33,090 --> 00:15:36,390
- You had no right to go out with him.     - That is the most ridiculous...

253
00:15:36,810 --> 00:15:38,890
- You sold me out!     - I did not sell you out!

254
00:15:39,180 --> 00:15:42,560
- Yes, you did! You absolutely sold me...     - Would you let me talk?

255
00:15:45,190 --> 00:15:47,360
Did you just flick me?

256
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:51,280
Okay, well, you wouldn't let me finish and I was just... Ow!

257
00:15:51,450 --> 00:15:53,910
- Stop it! Ow!     - Ow!

258
00:15:54,070 --> 00:15:55,410
- Stop.     - Stop.

259
00:15:55,570 --> 00:15:58,490
- All right. No, let's not do this.     - No!

260
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:02,000
- Happy thoughts.     - No!

261
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:06,290
- Stop it!     - Oh! Oh!

262
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:09,380
Okay, now I'm gonna kick some ass!

263
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:12,840
- Ow!     - Ow!

264
00:16:13,010 --> 00:16:15,680
- Ow. Ow. Ow.     - I know, I know.

265
00:16:17,180 --> 00:16:22,060
All right. Now, I will let go if you both stop.

266
00:16:22,230 --> 00:16:23,890
- Fine.     - Fine.

267
00:16:24,690 --> 00:16:26,020
There we go.

268
00:16:27,230 --> 00:16:31,780
Ha. You know what? If we were in prison, you guys would be like my bitches.

269
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:42,080
Okay, buddy boy, here it is.

270
00:16:42,830 --> 00:16:46,540
You hide my clothes? I'm wearing everything you own.

271
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,380
Oh, my God!

272
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:54,380
Look at me, I'm Chandler! Could I be wearing any more clothes?

273
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:58,260
Maybe if I wasn't going "commando."

274
00:17:01,470 --> 00:17:07,270
Whew. I tell you, it's hot with all this stuff on. I'd better not do any lunges.

275
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:00,820
Joey?

276
00:18:01,950 --> 00:18:05,700
Got you the Joey special. Two pizzas!

277
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:08,080
Joe?

278
00:18:09,750 --> 00:18:11,790
Hello? Damn it!

279
00:18:14,050 --> 00:18:15,090
Hello?

280
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:19,220
No, Joey's not here right now, but I can take a message. I think.

281
00:18:20,470 --> 00:18:23,970
He's still got a chance for the part? That's great news!

282
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:28,100
Well, no, obviously not for the actor who was mauled by his dog.

283
00:18:29,020 --> 00:18:32,110
Well, that's great. I will give Joey the message. Thank you.

284
00:18:32,270 --> 00:18:33,310
Yes!

285
00:18:34,690 --> 00:18:35,730
Okay.

286
00:18:36,190 --> 00:18:37,530
Mac...

287
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,900
audition...

288
00:18:40,740 --> 00:18:42,700
at 2.

289
00:18:43,950 --> 00:18:45,370
Allergy...

290
00:18:45,910 --> 00:18:47,160
actor...

291
00:18:48,330 --> 00:18:49,910
attacked.

292
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:57,260
By dog...

293
00:18:57,670 --> 00:18:59,090
not...

294
00:18:59,470 --> 00:19:01,050
flowers.

295
00:19:08,930 --> 00:19:12,150
- Hey.     - Please tell me you got the message.

296
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:15,110
- What message?     - The actor playing Mac couldn't do it.

297
00:19:15,270 --> 00:19:19,110
- They needed to see you at 2:00.     - What? It's 6:00!

298
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:21,650
Look! I wrote it! I wrote it on the board!

299
00:19:21,820 --> 00:19:24,740
I wrote it on the board, then went looking all over for you!

300
00:19:24,910 --> 00:19:26,660
I went to Ross's, the coffee house.

301
00:19:26,830 --> 00:19:29,660
I went to any place that they make sandwiches!

302
00:19:30,290 --> 00:19:33,170
- I can't believe this, Chandler!     - I'm sorry.

303
00:19:33,830 --> 00:19:35,210
I don't know what to say!

304
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:38,880
You might say, "Congratulations."

305
00:19:39,050 --> 00:19:42,930
I saw the board, I went to the audition, I got the part!

306
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:46,260
Was that supposed to be funny? I was worried over here.

307
00:19:46,430 --> 00:19:50,310
- I'm sorry.     - At times that fake-out thing is mean.

308
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:52,940
Okay, man. I'm sorry. I did not mean to make you feel bad.

309
00:19:53,100 --> 00:19:54,730
Well, that's good.

310
00:19:54,900 --> 00:19:58,110
Because you didn't. And I'm incredibly happy for you!

311
00:19:58,730 --> 00:20:00,440
That's mean!

312
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:04,910
- You had me going there!     - We could do this all day.

313
00:20:05,070 --> 00:20:06,620
Yeah, you're right.

314
00:20:07,330 --> 00:20:10,040
Look, let's talk about what a huge star I'm gonna be.

315
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:12,410
You are gonna be a huge star. I'm gonna hug you.

316
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:14,250
- You hug me.     - All right.

317
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:46,160
- Do we do this too much?     - I think so.

318
00:20:46,370 --> 00:20:48,320
- Yeah. Get off me.     - Yeah.

319
00:20:56,330 --> 00:20:58,880
"Come on, C.H.E.E.S.E., I'm not leaving without you.

320
00:20:59,040 --> 00:21:02,210
Try routing your backup power source through your primary CPU."

321
00:21:02,380 --> 00:21:07,010
"I can't! My circuits are fried! They're fried, I tell you!"

322
00:21:09,100 --> 00:21:10,640
Wow.

323
00:21:11,220 --> 00:21:13,310
"Well, then I'll just have to carry you."

324
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:15,480
"That'll be a neat trick...

325
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:19,310
when you're dead!"

326
00:21:20,360 --> 00:21:22,070
Ross, you don't have to yell.

327
00:21:22,230 --> 00:21:26,360
There was just an explosion, okay? My hearing would be impaired.

328
00:21:27,490 --> 00:21:28,910
I thought you were excellent.

329
00:21:29,070 --> 00:21:32,080
In fact, for a minute there, I was like, "Ooh, where did Ross go?"

330
00:21:33,330 --> 00:21:37,000
Thank you. And I have to say that first scene where you meet Mac...

331
00:21:37,170 --> 00:21:39,290
- Yeah.     - Oh, my God. I mean...

332
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:40,580
You know what?

333
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:43,840
I think that's enough for today. Thanks for your help.

334
00:21:46,220 --> 00:21:48,550
- Holding us back.     - Totally.

